{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And dwell there.</b> To direct your mind before you build the altar, as they said of blessed memory: the early pious ones would linger one hour and then pray, so that they might direct their hearts toward the Place (Berakhot 30b)." "<b>And make there an altar to El who appeared to you when you fled.</b> To give thanks that He fulfilled for you the promise He made there, as they said (Berakhot 54a): one blesses, בָּרוּךְ שֶׁעָשָׂה לִי נֵס בַּמָּקוֹם הַזֶּה — 'Blessed is He who did a miracle for me in this place.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:18.258218877Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}